# The repo is authored with LF line endings and Prettier (via eslint-plugin-prettier)
# enforces them, so `npm run lint` fails on a CRLF checkout. Pin the working tree
# to LF on every platform rather than relying on each contributor's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary / generated assets that must not be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.wasm binary
